"""Classification table for scripts/godot_runtime_warnings.py.

Each row is (file regex, message regex, target). The first matching row wins.
Targets: "rule:<id>" when a rule reports the stored configuration that makes Godot print the message,
"candidate:<reason>" when stored state could show it but no rule exists yet,
or "<category>:<reason>" with category environment, script, editor, internal, clamped, content or runtime.
"""

